
                       geant4-11-03-ref-04
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o New "@@" keyword to be used in UI commands taking a macro file name;
   it allows to create a temporary macro file with the commands being
   defined following it, until a "/control/endRecord" command is specified.
 o New class G4DNABornIonisationModel, a new implementation of the Born model
   using G4DNASamplingTable; new class G4DNASamplingTable allowing share
   sampling data between threads; new class G4ChemReboundTransportation to
   handle the rebound transportation of the molecule.
 o New alternative hadronic de-excitation FermiBreakUp model G4FermiBreakUpAN
   and support classes.
 o Introducing RayTracerQt visualisation driver, controlled by the
   GEANT4_USE_RAYTRACER_QT configuration flag.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(*)  Fixes included in patch release 11.3.2

